 the clock. Perfect for kids and learners of all ages, MATH-A-MOLE combines arcade action with brain training to make learning math exciting and interactive!", "short_description": "Sharpen your math skills in a fast-paced, arcade-style challenge! In MATH-A-MOLE, you use a virtual hammer to whack the mole with the correct answer to each math problem. It's a fun and energetic way to practice addition, subtraction, and more, perfect for learners of all ages!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1B3KNESmF2S8bFCdivo6S0UMBaS68peIqZfzvLoRR6-8/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Chaac Technologies", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://chaac.tech/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24246571431620119"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821568_1446995679633631_5695035274869763734_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g3zOYTEgmKgQ7kNvwElVqjp&_nc_oc=AdpMjJxE-0iuzDfLpcj-3f5lUn_M3vIgj9zYpywMHGJwZnLt0ydmI31Bwf0OsFQkazg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af315wPCAnOsEB8D5wevMlK2-zstJdtZseYOTbRBSUptlw&oe=69D3A2ED"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name